{"id":"000W9C","title":"Frustrated Pitcher","author":"LittleNightmaresLady","solvedCount":3,"difficulty":4,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-11-28T13:12:11+00:00","posted":"Heute, 05:37 Uhr","rules":"Was hesitant to put this one on this site since it’s not typically my style of puzzle, but eventually decided to. I wanted to make a puzzle based on the pitcher from a Rhythm game, so this is an easier puzzle than normal. I hope you enjoy!\n\nRules:\n\n-Normal sudoku rules apply.\n\n-Cells along a purple line form a set of consecutive digits in any order, without repeats.\n\n-Divide each grey line into one or more contiguous, non-overlapping group of cells that each sum to 10. Every cell on the line belongs to exactly one group.\n\n-Every set of 3 consecutive cells along a peach line must contain a low digit (1,2,3), a medium digit (4,5,6), and a high digit (7,8,9).\n\n-Digits along a thermo must increase from the bulb end.\n\n-Adjacent cells along a orange line must differ by at least 4.\n\nLink:\n\nCTC","solutionCode":"Column 1","tags":["Sudoku","Renban (Variante)","Thermo (Variante)","Entropie (Thema)"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/x7eo0jep9p","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/x7eo0jep9p","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":9,"cages":0,"hasSolution":true,"features":["lines","underlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-11-28T13:12:11+00:00"}